OL,3,GNEWSAGPS tracking of bailed suspects to
OL,4,Astart next year, says Swinney
OL,5,
OL,6,FGPS tracking of people on bail,
OL,7,Fincluding those suspected of domestic
OL,8,Fabuse, is to begin in parts of central
OL,9,FScotland next year, John Swinney has
OL,10,Fconfirmed.
OL,12,FThe first minister updated parliament
OL,13,Fon his plans for a pilot scheme in
OL,14,FTayside, Fife and Central during a
OL,15,FScottish Parliament debate on tackling
OL,16,Fviolence against women.
OL,18,FIt came after he spoke to domestic
OL,19,Fabuse survivors and relatives of
OL,20,Fvictims at a Holyrood meeting hosted by
OL,21,FScottish Conservative leader Russell
OL,22,FFindlay.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
