OL,3,GNEWSAGPS tracking of bailed suspects to
OL,4,Astart next year, says Swinney
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has been criticised over
OL,7,Fthe slow rollout of GPS equipment,
OL,8,Fwhich is used far less in Scotland than
OL,9,Fin some other countries.
